  "display_fullname": "Boosts Generic Might of the Empire Generic Might of the Empire",
  "display_help": "The Might of the Empire enhancement fills the user with a strong sense of power thus increasing a power's damage by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}% and recharge by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%.  Additionally, the power that the Might of the Empire enhancement is slotted into will have a minor chance to knockdown its target, however this effect will cease to trigger once the player reaches level 21.  This effect will trigger roughly 2 times per minute.",
